      "decision_index": 137,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Discarded Icetill Explorer instead of a duplicate Talisman of Impulse. They already have a Talisman of Impulse on the battlefield, making a second copy less valuable. Icetill Explorer's ability to play lands from graveyard (5+ lands in graveyard) and make additional land drops would have been more impactful for ramping into Emrakul or Ugin.",
      "action_taken": "Discarded Icetill Explorer",
      "better_line": "Discard one of the two Talisman of Impulse copies, since one is already on the battlefield and the duplicate provides less unique value than Icetill Explorer's land recursion.",
      "type": "blunder",
